      "pricingPageEntitlementsEyebrow": "How entitlements work",
      "pricingPageEntitlementsTitle": "Quotas, features, and school overrides.",
      "pricingPageEntSeatTitle": "Seats & storage",
      "pricingPageEntSeatBody": "Each plan sets student, staff, and storage ceilings. Unlimited means no hard cap in the catalog for that dimension.",
      "pricingPageEntFeatureTitle": "Feature entitlements",
      "pricingPageEntFeatureBody": "Module access follows the plan’s feature keys — the same catalog Super Admin edits for the platform.",
      "pricingPageEntOverrideTitle": "School overrides",
      "pricingPageEntOverrideBody": "After approval, Super Admin may adjust a school’s plan or per-tenant overrides. List prices here are starting points, not a locked cart.",
      "pricingPageFaqEyebrow": "Pricing FAQ",
      "pricingPageFaqTitle": "Billing questions, answered honestly.",
      "pricingPageFaqBody": "Trials, Free tier, registration, and currency — without fake SaaS checkout claims.",
      "pricingPageFaq1q": "Is there a free trial?",
      "pricingPageFaq1a": "Trial days appear on plans that include them in the catalog (for example Trial). Free is always available within its seat and feature limits.",
      "pricingPageFaq2q": "What is included in Free?",
      "pricingPageFaq2a": "Core portal, parent portal, communications, notifications, attendance, classrooms, calendar, and documents — within Free seat and storage quotas. See the comparison matrix for the exact key list.",
      "pricingPageFaq3q": "How does school registration work?",
      "pricingPageFaq3a": "Submit the public register form. We review the application, provision the tenant, and apply the appropriate plan entitlements. You do not complete a platform Stripe checkout on this marketing site.",
      "pricingPageFaq4q": "How do we talk about Enterprise?",
      "pricingPageFaq4a": "Start with Register school and note Enterprise needs in your message. Custom domain and full catalog are listed on the Enterprise plan; commercial terms are handled after review.",
      "pricingPageFaq5q": "What currency are these prices?",
      "pricingPageFaq5a": "Published amounts are USD list rates for school tenants. Local invoicing or overrides may apply after approval.",
